    {
      "text": "Russell Crowe's Patek was only borrowed.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "hook"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Aaron Taylor Johnson told Jimmy Kimmel about working with Russell Crowe.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "title",
        "text": "Kimmel",
        "sub": "The story",
        "piece": "ring",
        "stone": "topaz",
        "metal": "platinum",
        "cut": "oval"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Crowe played his father in the film Kraven the Hunter.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "piece",
        "piece": "necklace",
        "stone": "ruby",
        "cut": "pear",
        "metal": "platinum",
        "label": "Playing his father"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Crowe stayed in character and showed him his Patek Philippe watch.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "real",
        "src": "479-russell-crowe-s-patek-was-only-borrowed-0.jpg",
        "fit": "card",
        "label": "A Patek Philippe",
        "credit": "Public domain, via Wikimedia Commons"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "He insisted, in a Russian accent, that it was the real thing.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "piece",
        "piece": "earrings",
        "stone": "diamond",
        "cut": "round",
        "metal": "platinum",
        "label": "The real thing"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Taylor Johnson hinted by quoting Patek's slogan about never really owning one.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "real",
        "src": "479-russell-crowe-s-patek-was-only-borrowed-1.jpg",
        "fit": "card",
        "label": "A Patek Philippe watch",
        "credit": "Public domain, via Wikimedia Commons"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "When filming ended, Crowe offered a handshake, and there was no watch.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "piece",
        "piece": "band",
        "stone": "citrine",
        "metal": "platinum",
        "label": "A handshake"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Crowe explained that it was on loan and had to go back.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "piece",
        "piece": "eternity",
        "stone": "emerald",
        "metal": "platinum",
        "stones": 10,
        "label": "On loan"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "He said it was worth half a million dollars.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "piece",
        "piece": "brooch",
        "stone": "amethyst",
        "cut": "round",
        "petals": 8,
        "metal": "platinum",
        "label": "Half a million"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The actors playing his sons got cash and a Les Paul guitar.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "piece",
        "piece": "ring",
        "stone": "pink",
        "cut": "cushion",
